% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/data_protection/gdpr_impact_assessment_prior_consultation. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% THIS ORDER HAS NO FIGURES. parameters-sources.yaml is not a commissioning
% register, and the pinned text (Regulation (EU) 2016/679 Art 36(1) and
% Art 36(5)) carries no threshold, period, amount or table that this order
% computes with. The Art 36(2) periods (eight weeks, extendable by six) bind
% the supervisory authority and are deferred (reading 12): no deadline is
% computed, so no parameter_source/2 record and no constant_value/2 is declared.
% Later phases must not add figures here.
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
